### MaterialSales — CREATE (expects 201 Created; total = quantity × price; quantity leaves the lot stock)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002
@materialLotId = 1

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/material-sales
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Venta de cartón a transformadora",
  "buyerName": "Papeles Reciclados de la Costa S.A.S.",
  "materialLotId": {{materialLotId}},
  "quantityKg": 250,
  "unitPricePerKg": 560,
  "saleDate": "2026-10-01",
  "description": "Despacho en camión de 3 toneladas"
}

### MaterialSales — CREATE more than the lot stock (expects 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/material-sales
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Venta excesiva",
  "buyerName": "Papeles Reciclados de la Costa S.A.S.",
  "materialLotId": {{materialLotId}},
  "quantityKg": 99999999,
  "unitPricePerKg": 1
}

### MaterialSales — CREATE sending totalAmount (expects 400 Bad Request: the server computes it)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/material-sales
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Total enviado",
  "buyerName": "Cliente",
  "materialLotId": {{materialLotId}},
  "quantityKg": 10,
  "unitPricePerKg": 100,
  "totalAmount": 1000
}
